    "resolution": "640x352 redetail -> SeedVR2 restore/upscale to 1080p",
    "passes": "LTX single-pass (8 steps) + SeedVR2 restoration",
    "encoding": "h264 all-intra (CRF 18, keyframe every frame - no motion artifacts)",
    "note": "Chains LTX-2.5 V2V redetail with SeedVR2 diffusion restoration. SeedVR2 cleans quantization/motion artifacts AND upscales to 1080p in one pass. Requires ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler (in add-dependancies.sh) and models from prepopulate_serverless.py --seedvr2-only."
  },
